  "description": "JOBMEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H76 Dy4 N8 O16,6(C1 H4 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.684-4.171 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.19-115.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H76Dy4N8O16·6(CH4O)·4(H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
